## Determinism

Every seeded step sorts before it samples and seeds its generator from the policy seed ({{ v('policy.seed') }}) and a label; every published table has a stable tie break; the manifest is identical under two PYTHONHASHSEED values; caches are keyed by a digest of their inputs and a changed input is a miss.
